824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"纪归梦 其一","author":"耶律铸","text":"睡鸭残香隔梦闻，晓莺啼破五更春。\n千秋万古兰窗蝶，只属行云行雨人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12428,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"纪归梦 其二","author":"耶律铸","text":"为蝶为周尽自分，华胥元自是青春。\n寒梅计岂罗浮月，偏照淩波解佩人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12429,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"西园春事","author":"耶律铸","text":"西园春事画图中，难状司春造化功。\n何限花心争动处，不应都是夜来风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12430,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"西园席上调元子不至","author":"耶律铸","text":"白玉堂前白日长，满前莺燕语如簧。\n那知沈饭非荒宴，待与扬鞭问葛彊。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12431,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"席上 其一","author":"耶律铸","text":"习饮醉乡抛浩劫，葆真灵液反天和。\n方知世上閒滋味，元比神仙不较多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12432,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"席上 其二","author":"耶律铸","text":"彩云行雨阳台梦，罗袜生尘洛浦秋。\n飞起一双花上蝶，晚风吹上玉搔头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12433,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"初上缙云五湖别业","author":"耶律铸","text":"旋移松竹养烟霞，人笑猖披不润家。\n可要广栽桃李树，年来强半是狂花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12434,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游壶春园","author":"耶律铸","text":"雨横风狂过一春，养花天气少温存。\n满前何限关心事，且是无人详细论。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12435,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"翠水别业即事","author":"耶律铸","text":"或命巾车与鹿车，就花深处便倾壶。\n风流哲匠天然句，状出双溪醉隐图。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12436,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题易安堂壁","author":"耶律铸","text":"且言居易有何难，俟命由来足易安。\n高谢畏途诚可意，见人行险我心寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12437,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"终夕风雨早起书待旦斋壁","author":"耶律铸","text":"银箭知传弟几更，玉壶清漏不闻声。\n雄鸡本是司晨物，未可非时妄一鸣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12438,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"仁寿镇柳浪","author":"耶律铸","text":"柳浪风寒䆉稏香，旋移床就树阴凉。\n待教野老题名号，独醉痴仙避暑庄。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12439,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"汎城南莲湖","author":"耶律铸","text":"管弦声破水云幽，浪里香风过画楼。\n相与兼花折荷叶，乱遮斜日上兰舟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12440,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题合欢亭","author":"耶律铸","text":"只合欢游引玉舟，骈罗蠲忿列忘忧。\n自从收得河边水，须信人閒有帝休。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12441,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"曲水游 其一","author":"耶律铸","text":"宴随步障水西东，曲水烟光锦绣中。\n杨柳结弮垂柳带，桃花嘶立落花风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12442,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"曲水游 其二","author":"耶律铸","text":"延引仙人莲叶舟，衣冠杂沓载经州。\n风流今日兰亭会，引入桃源水上头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12443,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"方湖钓鱼台","author":"耶律铸","text":"杜梨花外杜鹃啼，醉倚春风上钓矶。\n真是一声声更切，不知犹更劝谁归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12444,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"玉溪","author":"耶律铸","text":"玉溪声泻玉声寒，流绕祥云瑞霭閒。\n却是冰壶凉世界，始知元自在人寰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12445,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"水平桥","author":"耶律铸","text":"洞箫吹罢思无聊，却下閒庭弄柳条。\n寂寂小园春昼永，一声啼鸟水平桥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12446,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"白石山","author":"耶律铸","text":"山本无情不解愁，年来底事也惊秋。\n古今阅尽兴亡恨，知为何人雪满头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12447,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山市吟","author":"耶律铸","text":"山阁连城日日新，千形万状只无人。\n自分长乐楼台象，不染长安市井尘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12448,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"桃源 其一","author":"耶律铸","text":"洞仙情分与桃源，尽与刘郎旧有缘。\n两手未为无用处，不妨和月弄清泉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12449,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"桃源 其二","author":"耶律铸","text":"惊风成陈花委尘，白日如驰催老人。\n只须深入桃源洞，留住朱颜占住春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12450,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过北村","author":"耶律铸","text":"麦穗经场谷尚青，县官严令督秋徵。\n嗔他问著西成事，斜倚锄耰并不应。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12451,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"观田","author":"耶律铸","text":"漠漠屯云翠拍天，人谣鬼咏是丰年。\n老农愁倚锄竿立，五谷虽成不值钱。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12452,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"秋日田行","author":"耶律铸","text":"野老郊迎顶斗炉，马前行语更相呼。\n田荒室露浑馀事，乞免官徵一岁租。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12453,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"灵城元日 其一","author":"耶律铸","text":"惆怅重明竟未回，尘扬沧海劫前灰。\n谁期六合披攘际，得引屠苏是后杯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12454,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"灵城元日 其二","author":"耶律铸","text":"未待金鸣送曙光，雁行罗列进桃汤。\n如何白兽尊中酒，尽日无人引一觞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12455,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"立春前一日对雪","author":"耶律铸","text":"桃李无言盼断春，值春潜处暖生云。\n晚来纵有残风雪，明日人閒总属春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12456,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"立春口号","author":"耶律铸","text":"细风吹绿水生波，翠陌瑶阡艳绮罗。\n春信朝来到人世，满城箫鼓醉人多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":12457,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]